{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"56115fc6a16c5663","type":"text","text":"Following the death of Killaris his most prised follower Verazanoth began to seed the start of a cult to continue the legacy of Killaris. Verazanoth himself was not a being of enough power to start this nation and so he began plotting. He started to bring more and more followers into this cult until it became a village then a city lead by the most powerful necromancer at this time being one named Nyrimith. So began the early stages of the rise of necromancers, during this time they continuously sought out living people to experiment on and in doing so caught the attention of the current strongest nearby power even though they were a continent away Koraki Kastro began sending spies to Unhileg. \n\nBecause of this Unhileg went back into the shadows for thousands of years waiting for their time to become great. ","x":-125,"y":-30,"width":625,"height":330},
		{"id":"4171d01d9c6f7b85","type":"text","text":"[[Ascension of the Raven Queen.canvas]]\n[[The Whispered One.canvas]]\n[[Verazanoth.canvas]]\n#Lore ","x":-200,"y":-160,"width":357,"height":102}
